      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I actually managed to figure out how to get it back! Render textures now have color formats in Unity 2022, so to have Post Processing appear, set the color format of your render texture to \"R16G16B16A16_SFLOAT\". This worked perfectly for me!",
