  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "For a while now, I noticed that my render texture cameras in my game worlds do not have PPS anymore, ever since the Unity 2022 update. The in-game POV has the PPS working, but cameras with render textures for recording or visual purposes do not have the bloom effect on them. Hopefully this can be fixed soon!",
